# Return the Favor, first mode: "Copy target instant spell, sorcery spell, activated ability, or triggered ability. You may
# choose new targets for the copy." (CR 707.10, 707.10c) Bot1 activates Goblin Bombardment at Bot2, sacrificing one of its
# two Ornithopters, and copies the ability with Return the Favor (Black Lotus's {R}{R}{R}: {R}{R} and the mode's {1}). The
# copy keeps Bot2 as its target and needs no creature sacrificed: the cost was paid for the original (the ruling), so the
# other Ornithopter stays. Bot2 takes 2.

